1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,616
One platform.

2
00:00:01,636 --> 00:00:03,329
Multiple businesses.

3
00:00:03,349 --> 00:00:06,957
Customer support grounded in each
organization's own knowledge.

4
00:00:07,883 --> 00:00:11,749
This is a multi-tenant AI customer support
platform.

5
00:00:11,769 --> 00:00:13,611
Each business gets a dashboard,

6
00:00:13,851 --> 00:00:15,448
a guided chatbot setup,

7
00:00:15,688 --> 00:00:16,799
a knowledge base,

8
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:18,711
an embeddable chat widget,

9
00:00:18,951 --> 00:00:20,460
and a shared team inbox.

10
00:00:21,617 --> 00:00:25,213
Documents are processed in the background,
from queued to ready.

11
00:00:25,517 --> 00:00:27,578
Answers carry their sources.

12
00:00:27,598 --> 00:00:32,272
This demo reply is a fixed sentence, but
the retrieval behind it is real.

13
00:00:32,512 --> 00:00:35,077
A second business cannot open this
workspace.

14
00:00:35,317 --> 00:00:38,565
A visitor's conversation survives a page
reload.

15
00:00:38,805 --> 00:00:40,897
Analytics come from recorded events,

16
00:00:42,092 --> 00:00:44,648
and installing the widget twice still
keeps one.

17
00:00:46,283 --> 00:00:48,137
Underneath are four layers.

18
00:00:48,157 --> 00:00:49,675
The experience layer:

19
00:00:49,695 --> 00:00:51,038
dashboard and widget.

20
00:00:51,278 --> 00:00:54,233
The application layer, built on FastAPI.

21
00:00:54,473 --> 00:00:56,514
Data and background processing.

22
00:00:56,754 --> 00:00:58,224
And RAG intelligence.

23
00:00:58,464 --> 00:01:03,083
It is one modular monolith, running as
several processes in containers.

24
00:01:04,017 --> 00:01:07,837
The first audit passed five hundred and
eighty-two backend tests,

25
00:01:07,857 --> 00:01:09,313
and still found problems.

26
00:01:09,553 --> 00:01:14,303
Today the listed local suites report
fifteen hundred and five passing tests.

27
00:01:14,667 --> 00:01:17,482
All seven audit findings pass locally,

28
00:01:17,502 --> 00:01:21,969
and the self-audit score rose from eighty
and a half to eighty-five point seven

29
00:01:21,989 --> 00:01:22,543
five.

30
00:01:22,783 --> 00:01:24,646
These are local results.

31
00:01:24,666 --> 00:01:28,149
Real AI quality and production readiness
are unproven.

32
00:01:29,083 --> 00:01:33,797
Software engineering, full-stack
development and AI engineering.

33
00:01:33,817 --> 00:01:37,260
The full technical case study covers the
details.

